  - timestamp: 55
    lineIT: Nei <color=#00AAFF>tuoi</color> occhi innocenti
    noteEN: Tuoi - your (plural)
  - timestamp: 65
    lineIT: Puro come il <color=#00AAFF>tuo</color> amor
    noteEN: Tuo - your (singular)
  - timestamp: 76
    lineIT: "Non so ancora se c'\xE8 <color=#00AAFF>lui</color>"
    noteEN: Lui - he
  - timestamp: 157
    lineIT: Mi va bene pure <color=#00AAFF>lei</color>
    noteEN: Lei - she
